### Guardar respuesta de formulario con responses simples — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:00:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba 1" },
    { "questionId": 2, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba 2" }
  ]
}

### Guardar respuesta completa (responses + tableResponses + job + coordenadas + copia al cliente) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:30:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Todo en orden" }
  ],
  "tableResponses": [
    { "sectionId": 1, "rowId": 1, "responses": ["OK", "Sin observaciones"] },
    { "sectionId": 1, "rowId": 2, "responses": ["OK", "Revisado"] }
  ],
  "copyToCustomer": true,
  "customerEmails": "cliente@email.com",
  "jobId": 1,
  "workplanExecutionId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "returnCount": 1,
  "deviceLatitude": 14.634915,
  "deviceLongitude": -90.506882
}

### Guardar respuesta de formulario solo-tabla (sin responses, solo tableResponses) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T11:00:00",
  "tableResponses": [
    { "sectionId": 1, "rowId": 1, "responses": ["Valor A", "Valor B"] }
  ]
}

### Guardar respuesta de formulario global de Webtrack (id negativo, p.ej. -1) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": -1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T11:30:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta a formulario global" }
  ]
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:00:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba" }
  ]
}

### Validación: sin organizationFormId → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:00:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba" }
  ]
}

### Validación: organizationFormId = 0 (no identifica formulario) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 0,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:00:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba" }
  ]
}

### Validación: sin responseDate → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "Respuesta de prueba" }
  ]
}

### Validación: sin responses ni tableResponses → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 1,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-21T10:00:00"
}

### WD-2050: formulario inexistente o fuera del scope del partner → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/OrganizationForms/saveResponse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationFormId": 999999999,
  "responseDate": "2026-08-24T10:00:00",
  "responses": [
    { "questionId": 1, "responseText": "No debería guardarse" }
  ]
}
